Blank telemetry card values require investigation. Initial hypothesis: data source error or visualization bug. Will examine data retrieval and display components separately to pinpoint the issue.

Live telemetry requires linking the mobile card to the /api/system/health endpoint; data will then populate the VRAM/temp/Sys RAM display. The image suggests a functioning VRAM Arbiter, confirmed by HTTP/1.1 200 OK responses, so the issue might lie in the frontend's data consumption from this source. Implementing the executor and stop button requires modifications to MobileStehouwerChat.jsx, including UI element additions and associated state management. It's crucial to consider if these changes must be mirrored in other frontend instances.

